A NOTE TO MM/1 USERS====================Diskmaster will run on an MM/1 computer as-is, but there will be no mouse,and the colours will be wrong/missing. I started to write an MM/1 screendriver function, but since I don't own an MM/1, I have not been able tocomplete it. The mouse driver also needs to be done.I hope that there are enough comments in the code to allow someone to dothis.If you need more information, my email address is:       bdevries@gil.ipswichcity.qld.gov.auor     bdevries@gil.com.auIf anyone does write the necessary code for MM/1 use, please send me theresultant source, so that I can include it in my archive.Regards,       Bob Devries